      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": ["# FLUX.2 Dev native four-reference workflow - no character LoRA\n\nTested locally on 2026-08-24 at 832x1248, 20 steps, guidance 4, Euler, Flux2Scheduler, four genuine photos at 0.40 MP each. Reference order is semantic: 1 front face, 2 three-quarter face, 3 torso, 4 full-body build. Each reference is VAE-encoded and appended through chained ReferenceLatent nodes after FluxGuidance. No negative prompt, character LoRA, crop, mask, face swap, composite, restoration, sharpening, or post-processing.\n\nBest untouched run: held-out identity centroid 0.6865, weakest held-out view 0.5788, 11 YOLO people, 6 detected faces. This is a strong diagnostic improvement but not a proven identity lock; visual review remains required."]
